{# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   PREDEFINED ROW REFERENCE — supplied by Foster Commerce (SABIN web agency)

   This is an existing production row from the SABIN site, provided as the
   pattern the gallery row must follow. It is a REFERENCE, not a starting
   point to edit: the gallery is a different row with different fields.

   What to take from it:
     - a single root element for the row (<article>), self-contained, with no
       assumptions about what sits above or below it
     - fields read off a `row` variable (row.heading, row.theme, ...)
     - theming through the shared colour macro, not hardcoded colour classes
     - named typography classes from the existing scale (copy-250, copy-400)
     - image transforms + srcset via ImagerX, not a bespoke image pipeline
     - lazy loading and async decoding already applied to media
     - alt text taken from the asset
     - small UI pieces pulled in as component includes
     - a full-bleed link implemented as an absolutely positioned anchor
       (`absolute inset-0`) over the media — this is the pattern the gallery's
       whole-tile link should use, with the corner Build icon as a second,
       sibling anchor stacked above it

   Note: the gallery's tiles must be real <a> anchors, as here. Build 2.0's
   gallery uses <button> for its cards; do not copy that.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------- #}

{% import '_macros/color' as color %}

<article class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-2 {{ color.bgColor(row.theme) }}">
  <div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center lg:aspect-square {{ row.imageAlignment == 'left' ? 'lg:order-2' : 'lg:order-1' }}">
   <div
    class="flex flex-col {{ row.textVerticalAlignment|default('between') == 'centered' ? 'justify-center' : 'justify-between' }} items-stretch gap-8 h-full w-full px-6 md:px-16 py-20 lg:max-w-[840px] lg:ml-auto lg:mr-0 lg:pr-0 lg:pl-16 {{ color.textColor(row.theme) }}"
   >
    <h2 class="copy-250">{{ row.heading|nl2br }}</h2>
    <div class="space-y-5 copy-400 lg:max-w-[420px] lg:mr-auto lg:ml-0">
     {{ row.summary }}
    </div>
   </div>
  </div>
  <figure class="relative flex flex-col justify-between items-stretch {{ row.imageAlignment == 'left' ? 'lg:order-1' : 'lg:order-2' }}">
   {% if row.image|default %}
    {% set rawImage = row.image.eagerly().one() %}
    {% set transformedImage = craft.imagerx.transformImage(rawImage,
     [
      { width: 400 },
      { width: 800 },
      { width: 1200 }
     ],
     {
      mode: 'crop',
      ratio: 1/1
     }
    ) %}
    <img loading="lazy" decoding="async"
     src="{{ transformedImage[0].url }}"
     srcset="{{ craft.imagerx.srcset(transformedImage) }}"
     class="aspect-square object-cover object-center lg:w-full lg:h-full"
     alt="{{ rawImage.alt }}"
    />
   {% endif %}

   {% if row.navLink|default %}
    <a href="{{ row.navLink.url }}" class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 px-6 py-12 text-white group sm:p-12 lg:p-24">
     <div class="text-xl md:text-2xl lg:text-4xl">
      {{ row.navLink.label }}
     </div>

     <div class="text-right">
      {% include '_components/includes/link-arrow' with {
       size: 'large'
      } %}
     </div>
    </a>
   {% endif %}
  </figure>
</article>
